        <item>
            <title>0.3.6</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 22:46:03 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>202611272244</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.6</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>New <code>kakeibo open-at-login on</code> (or <code>off</code>) turns Open at Login on or off from the command line or MCP, without opening Settings. With no state, it shows whether it is on. If macOS needs your approval first, it says so.</li>
<li>Building from source installs to <code>/Applications/Kakeibo.app</code> instead of <code>~/Applications</code> (<code>APP_DIR</code> picks another folder). Copies from the download or Homebrew are unaffected.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
