        </item>
        <item>
            <title>0.3.5</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 03:17:58 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>202611260317</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Lighter in the menu bar: Kakeibo wakes up about 0.6 times a second when idle, down from 2.7, because macOS can now batch its timers.</li>
<li>Reading your Claude Code logs uses about half the resident memory at its peak (510 MB instead of 1.1 GB for 2.9 GB of logs), at the same speed.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
